  description: "Constable Bambis had seen enough. His old friend was far gone, and
    in his place taked by a vengefull spirit. Unsheathing his trusty sword and shield,
    he dispelled the mage's tricks and ultimately managed to defead the evil within.
    \n\nHis old friend, turned foe, was now forever banished to the shadow realm,
    facing his worst fear: being forgotten. \nLegends say part of his spirit still
    may inhibit this realm, but such accounts are not to be believed. At least not
    completely..."
